@startuml Component_Network
!theme plain
skinparam component {
  BackgroundColor #F0F8FF
}
skinparam package {
  BackgroundColor #FAFAFA
}

title So do mang Docker va Nginx Routing

package "Docker Network: nginx" as NetNginx #FFE0E0 {
  [Nginx :80] as Nginx
  [Site :8000] as SiteN
  [WSEvent :15100-15102] as WSN
  [Bridge :9998-9999] as BridgeN
}

package "Docker Network: site" as NetSite #E0FFE0 {
  [Site :8000] as SiteS
  [Celery] as CeleryS
  [Bridge :9998] as BridgeS
  [Redis :6379] as RedisS
  [WSEvent] as WSS
}

package "Docker Network: db" as NetDB #E0E0FF {
  [Site] as SiteD
  [Celery] as CeleryD
  [Bridge] as BridgeD
  database "MariaDB :3306" as DBD
}

note right of NetNginx
  **Nginx Routing:**
  / -> Site:8000 (uWSGI)
  /static/ -> /assets/static/
  /media/ -> /media/
  /event/ -> WSEvent:15100 (WS)
  /channels/ -> WSEvent:15102 (Poll)
  /pdf/ -> /media/ (cache 7d)
  Max body: 64MB
  Timeout: 600s
end note

note right of NetSite
  **Internal Communication:**
  Site <-> Redis (cache, session)
  Celery <-> Redis (broker DB1)
  Site -> Bridge (TCP :9998)
  Bridge -> WSEvent (POST :15101)
end note

note right of NetDB
  **Database Access:**
  MariaDB UTF8MB4
  InnoDB engine
  Port 3306 (NOT exposed)
end note

@enduml
